From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 02:28:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Profile system: continuous features, EW + shrinkage, cold
 start (item 12)

- core/profiles.py: feature registry (14d), EW ratio-of-sums with 4-game
  half-life, empirical-Bayes shrinkage by opportunity count (14e), cold
  start from projection proxies + draft capital (14f), display-only
  archetype labels (14b)
- core/allocation.py: profile -> Dispersion and -> AllocationShares with
  posterior_n (parameter uncertainty, 1f) and weekly_phi (game-script
  share variation) for the item-14 hierarchical sim
- variance.py: td_inflation replaced with td_k (NB); the old scaled-Poisson
  scheme had inverted semantics (t>1 narrowed) and drew fractional TDs
- ProfileSnapshot model + migration; players.draft_pick for cold start
- POST /api/profiles/import + GET /api/profiles
- simulate job: per-player profile-driven dispersion, cold-start fallback

